WEBVTT

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:49.170
Just now, I...

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.460
lost my virginity.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:58.420
Mijuku mujou saredo

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:58.420
Inexperienced, heartless, but even so,

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:07.580
Utsukushiku are

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:07.580
Be beautiful

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:18.540
No Destiny fusawashiku nai

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:18.540
No Destiny, unworthy

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.470
You okay...?

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.470
Did something happen...?

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.470
I'll...

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.470
Be waiting for you...

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:20.500
Konnanja kitto monotarinai

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:20.500
If it's like this, then probably things will go well

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.330
Kurai katattokeba umaku iku

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.330
If we just talk as if it's never enough

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:24.580
Mono, kane, ai, koto,

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:24.580
Things, money, love, words,

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:27.330
I got here before you.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:27.330
I have the correct meeting place, right?

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:27.330
Did something happen? You okay?

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:27.330
Mou jikokenji akita

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:27.330
I'm tired of self-asserting myself already

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:33.540
Déjà vu nani ga sonna fuman nanda?

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:33.540
Déjà vu, what are you so unsatisfied about?

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:35.290
Sanzan wagamama katattoite

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:35.290
You've said all sorts of selfish things,

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:37.210
Kore ijou hoka ni nani ga iru?

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:37.210
what more could you possibly want?

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:42.000
Sonna tokoro mo warito kirai ja nai

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:42.000
I kind of don't mind that about you

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:47.630
Mou "kiki akitanda yo sono serifu"

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:47.630
Honestly, "I'm sick of hearing that line"

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:51.420
Chuuto hanpa dake ha iya

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:51.420
The one thing I don't want is ambiguousness

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.170
Mou ii aa shite kou shite ittetatte

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.170
Enough. Even if you say to do this or that,

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:56.040
Aishite doushite? iwaretatte

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:56.040
Even if you say love me, or why?

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.830
Asobi dakenara kantan de

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.830
It's easy if it's just for fun

00:01:57.830 --> 00:01:59.630
Shinken koushou muchakucha de

00:01:57.830 --> 00:01:59.630
And that it's reckless serious negotiating

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:02.960
Omoi mo shinai omoi kotoba

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:02.960
How many times are those worn out unexpectedly

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:06.040
Nando tsukai furusu noka?

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:06.040
Serious words going to be used?

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:09.130
Douse kitai shitetanda deki race demo

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:09.130
We were hoping anyway, even if it was a fixed race,

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:10.750
Inyou darake no phrase mo

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:10.750
Even all those quoted phrases,

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:15.380
Kakato mochiagaru kotoba taboo ni shite

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:15.380
Making backtracking words taboo

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:19.500
Kuuki wo yonda ame furanaide yo

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:19.500
Take a hint, don't let it rain

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:22.130
Domestic Girlfriend

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:30.710
Huh?

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:33.630
Yeah?

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.580
Fumiyaaaaa!

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:37.880
Whoa!
Fumiyaaaaa!

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:38.460
Fumiyaaaaa!

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:40.170
What's going on, all of a sudden?!

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:46.500
Ah... Your body's soft,
but it's different from a girl's softness...

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.710
Huh...?

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:49.540
HUH?!

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:52.960
You did it with a girl you just met?!

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:53.960
Yeah...

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.790
You have someone you like, right?!
How did this happen?

00:02:58.420 --> 00:02:59.750
It just sort of happened...

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:04.080
You know, it's the guys who say stuff like "it just sort
of happened" or "somehow" that piss me off the most!
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:06.880
You know, it's the guys who say stuff like "it just sort
of happened" or "somehow" that piss me off the most!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:13.580
I got invited to a mixer the day before yesterday and...

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:22.130
Hey, apparently that Kiriya got forcefully transferred
from his previous school for hitting on a female student.

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:24.790
For real?! He's one of those perverted teachers, then.

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:26.540
Well, it's just a rumor, though.

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:29.420
True or false... Natsuo, which do you think it is?

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:31.330
How would I know?

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.080
Just based on your gut. Whoa! Whoa!

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:36.880
Are you guys gossiping about sleazy rumors again?

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:38.710
Hina-chan...

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:42.000
What's this? Hina-chan, you interested in my butt?

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.670
That's "Hina-sensei"!

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:47.790
Too bad for you, I'm not interested in little brats.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:51.500
Fujii-kun, don't let those two over there corrupt you.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:56.580
Why is Natsuo the only one
who gets special treatment? That sucks!

00:03:56.830 --> 00:04:00.210
Isn't Hina-chan great? I wanna go out with her!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:03.170
You idiot, she's not gonna give a student the time of day.

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:05.460
Besides, isn't there talk that she has a boyfriend?

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:11.670
Well, why don't we students have fun
among our fellow students?

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:12.960
Huh?

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:14.790
Cheers!

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:18.580
Well, I guess it's true that friends
of a cute girl are cute too!

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:20.960
Sorry to make you come all the way out here.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.630
Not at all!

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.710
Well, let's start with introductions. After you!

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:28.380
Okay! I'm Rika, your host, and I go
to the same cram school as Yuya-kun!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.500
I'm Miina, the "It Girl" of Sakuragawa High!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.710
You'd actually say that?!

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:35.290
I'm Kanae, also a friend.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.420
Hey Rui, it's your turn.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:44.960
Rui Tachibana.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:49.330
Come on, Rui! This is the kind of situation
where you should be more excited, okay?

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.290
Are you not having fun?

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:02.130
What?

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:05.210
It seems like you've been in a bad mood
this whole time, so I was curious.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:09.500
This is how I normally am. I'm just not used to this.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:14.750
Me too. Up until middle school, I was a dorky four-eyes,
so I never did this kind of thing.

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:16.130
"Dorky"?

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:21.630
A middle school friend did one of those "make-me-over
plans" so that I wouldn't be picked on in high school...

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:25.540
He made me change to contacts,
and he changed my hairstyle for me, too.

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:36.960
You'll get the hang of this kind of thing
eventually, right? Probably...

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:41.630
Hey...

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.460
Want to sneak out of here together?

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:54.580
Won't everyone be worried?

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:57.420
They say there's a tacit agreement about sneaking out.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.960
I'd like to ask you for a little favor...

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:03.500
Is that okay?

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.830
Huh? Sure... That's okay with me...

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:18.830
This place...

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.380
This is my house. At this time of day,
no one will be coming home, so...

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:23.330
Huh?

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:25.750
This way.

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:32.790
Um...

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:35.580
I totally don't understand what's going on here.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:36.540
Hey...

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.460
Will you have sex with me here?

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:43.210
Huh?!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:45.830
If you don't want to, it's okay, you can leave...

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:48.630
I-it's not about wanting to or not, but...

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:51.460
Why me?

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:55.960
I want to try it, for the sake of experience.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:02.830
It's like everything else, but you know how people
in-the-know talk down towards people who aren't?

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:05.420
Saying something like, "You wouldn't understand."

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:09.080
If I'm being treated like a child and I can't even
have a proper conversation about it,

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:11.000
then I want to know what it's like.

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:12.960
That's all.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:15.000
But, you know, this kind of thing-

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.170
I don't have anyone I like, and I don't plan
on having a boyfriend either.

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:22.580
But then, why me? Yuya and the others
would be better at something like this...

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:26.460
Yeah, you clearly don't look like you're used to this.

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:29.080
That's why I asked you.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:33.130
It'd be irritating if I got taken advantage of
or something by someone who's used to this.

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:34.710
Okay?

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:41.290
"Besides, isn't there talk that she has a boyfriend?"

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.000
O-okay...

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:56.960
Was it okay, the way it was...?

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.290
I don't know.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:02.540
It's just... It was kind of like, "So that's how it is."

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.960
It's not about how you did or didn't do...

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:10.080
It just made me think that I stayed the same anyway...

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.330
If we do meet again, we'll be strangers...

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:17.630
Okay...

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:23.170
What the hell was that?

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:25.500
It hasn't really hit me yet either.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:30.080
But then, why is a lucky boy like you looking so iffy?

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:33.630
At first, I was totally ecstatic, but as time went by,

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:38.250
I started thinking of whether it was a good thing
to have lost it this way, and stuff like that...

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:41.960
Because, you know, I have someone I like...

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:49.790
I think it's fine, right? Besides, in your case,
you know it's going to be an unrequited crush.

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:57.630
Hey, where's Natsuo?

00:08:57.630 --> 00:08:58.670
I don't know.

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:02.630
What the hell?! I wanted to grill him
on yesterday's events.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:06.880
Oh my!

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:11.670
And here I was thinking there was already
someone here. And why, if it isn't you, Fujii-sensei!

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:13.540
Please don't call me by that name.

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:15.580
Well? Is it coming along?

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:16.670
Please don't look!

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:20.580
You said you'd let me read it first!

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:25.170
After I finish it. I don't like the idea of having it read
while it's still being worked on.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:29.750
Aw! I should've read it before, when I'd picked it up.

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.250
Time flies...

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:46.830
It's already been a year since then.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:51.080
I was a brand-new teacher and things
like class weren't going well and...

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:53.250
Did something happen?

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:53.750
Huh?

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:57.500
You've come here by yourself before,
when you've been feeling down, so...

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:02.000
If you don't mind that it's me,
I can at least listen to you vent-

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.380
Come on! What a cocky thing to say!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.750
Is that how you hit on girls?

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:10.460
As if anyone would fall for something like that.
Especially you, Sensei.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.790
Well, children are outside my field of interest.

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.380
But...

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:19.630
A nice boy may be an exception.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.250
Just kidding.

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:25.750
Well Fujii-kun, make sure you're not late to class either.

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:38.000
Yes...

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:39.500
I'm home...

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:41.710
Mm-hmm... Yes...

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.170
Wanna go play basketball after we eat?

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:01.290
I'll go! I'll go!

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:03.330
Sorry, I've got a little...

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:04.880
Huh?! What's up?

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:09.670
Even lunch breaks are valuable writing time, so...

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:25.130
Something did happen after all, didn't it?

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:33.000
Ugh! You've seen me in a really uncool state.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:34.710
What happened?

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:38.210
Yesterday's drama was so touching that...

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:41.170
You don't have to bother with such an obvious evasion.

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:44.380
I'm fine. I'm fine. It's not a big deal, so.

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:48.830
Is it not even okay to just let me listen?
It's not good to agonize over it all by yourself.

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:53.040
I... I worry about you, Sensei, so...

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:58.830
You're truly a nice boy, Fujii-kun. But...

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:02.000
Grown-ups have grown-up things they have to deal with.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:09.420
Please don't treat me like a kid!

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.250
What do you mean, "grown-up things to deal with"?!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:15.170
What could be so different
between you and me, Sensei?!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:20.210
Someone like me might not look
dependable to you, Sensei, but even still, I...!

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:21.540
Sensei, I...!

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:37.380
"Sensei, I see you look so pitiful"?

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:42.750
Never... mind...

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:47.290
I'm home.

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:49.080
Oh, welcome home.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:50.170
You were on the phone again?

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:51.580
Y-yeah...

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:01.500
I'd like to ask you for a favor.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.210
I don't have anyone I like.

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:04.380
Fujii-kun.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:06.580
Well, children are outside my field of interest.

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:12.330
...tsuo... Natsuo... Natsuo!

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:15.630
What?! I keep telling you not to come in
without a heads up!

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:17.710
I-is this that rebellious phase?

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:20.790
So, what do you want?

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:26.670
Um, as I was thinking of when to talk to you about it,
things just kept moving along rapidly and...

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:30.500
Your dad here, is thinking of getting remarried.

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:34.460
Th-this is rather sudden.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:36.290
Well, I guess that's all right.

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:38.500
It's been ten years since mom died, so.

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:42.460
Y-you sure? Well, the thing is,
she's coming to say hi right now.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:44.380
What?! But, so soon?!

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:45.250
They're here!

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:46.170
They're here! They're here! They're here!

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:47.710
Huh?! Hey! Wait!
They're here! They're here! They're here!

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:49.540
Hello!

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:54.380
Why, hello! Thank you very much for inviting us over.

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:56.710
Now then, please! Come on in!

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.330
Come on, you two. Make your introductions too.

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:10.790
Fujii-kun?!

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:13.790
S..Sensei?! Why?!

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:17.790
No way! Fujii-san's kid was Fujii-kun?!

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.830
Why would you say such an obvious thing?

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:22.750
That's not what I mean! He's a student at my school!

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:24.040
I don't get it!
Oh my! Is that true?

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:26.460
I don't get it! Sensei is the daughter
of my old man's remarriage partner?!
It's not that rare of a last name,

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:28.420
I don't get it! Sensei is the daughter
of my old man's remarriage partner?!
but I never thought that they were father and son after all!

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:30.710
Natsuo?!

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:31.880
Fujii-kun?!
Oh no!

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:37.460
Are you all right?

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:40.630
Oh, yes... I just got a little dizzy.

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:42.170
But what a surprise!

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:46.290
I never thought I'd become family with Fujii-
I mean, Natsuo-kun...

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:48.170
It's too soon to say that yet.

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:50.830
To find out that Natsuo was your daughter's student...

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:52.710
Perhaps this is also fate?

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:55.630
Oh, right, right. This is my younger sister, Rui.

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:57.500
I think she's the same age as you, Natsuo-kun.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.460
She's a little shy, but...

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:04.170
Huh? Do you two know each other, by any chance?

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.960
Uh, no... That is...

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:08.920
First time we've met.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.330
Of course. We do live far apart, so.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.580
Well then, once again...

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:19.080
My name is Tsukiko Tachibana, and I have been
dating your father. It is a pleasure to meet you.

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:21.670
Hello. I'm his son, Natsuo.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:25.290
Um, excuse me...

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:27.920
What is it that you like about my old man?

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:31.960
There are many things, but if I had to choose,
I think it's his sincerity.

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:37.460
My previous husband had a mistress whom he
left me for. And I was full of so much hate because of it...

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:41.500
I had thought that I could never
trust men ever again, but...

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:46.290
I will continue to support you,
so that the ice around your heart melts!

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.630
Honestly, I thought he was the only one for me!

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:52.670
Tsukiko-san!

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:54.960
My old man said something that cheesy...?

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:04.790
The best beer is after a day of work and after a bath!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.250
Sensei, you like to drink?

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:11.880
It's too bad. If you were an adult, Natsuo-kun,
then we could drink together.

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.880
I... I guess so...

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.960
Excuse me. I've got to go to the bathroom-

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:29.500
Did you, by any chance, know about this?

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:30.880
I didn't know!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:32.130
I see...

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:35.830
I'd heard that Fujii-san has a son
the same age as me, but...

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:38.130
I never expected something like this to happen...

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:39.920
What're you gonna do?

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.000
About what?

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.580
About the remarriage. You know, because...

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:44.960
I'm for it.

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:45.670
Huh?

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:52.750
After divorcing my dad, Mom was constantly
saying bad things about him and I didn't like that.

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:56.540
But ever since she got to know Fujii-san,

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:59.830
she's always in good spirits
and seems to be enjoying every day.

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:04.540
So, I don't want to take away Mom's happiness
because of some stupid reason.

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:08.380
Although whatever you decide is up to you.

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.330
Well, that was fun.

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:17.290
I'm sorry we couldn't do much in terms of our hospitality.

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:21.330
You can leave the dishes. I'll take care of them.

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:22.330
Okay...

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:28.130
Hey Dad...

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:31.710
The remarriage... You should do it.

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:37.330
It would've been better
if you'd told me a little sooner, but...

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:41.170
Well, you've worked hard
all by yourself for a long time, so...

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:45.290
Thank you. And I'm sorry.

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:49.960
It's not as if I've forgotten about your mother
who passed away, you know...

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:52.250
I know...

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:58.500
I know this is sudden, but I've decided to buy
a pre-owned house! We move next week!

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:00.330
Why is everything so sudden?!

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:04.790
You're becoming siblings with the girl
you had sex with AND your sensei?!

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:05.790
Yeah...

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:08.250
I don't get it.

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:09.040
I thought so.

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:15.670
Well, looks like things have gotten really complicated...

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:19.670
But, at this point, don't you think
you've got no chance now?

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:24.460
It's bad enough there's that hurdle
between teacher and student.

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:26.330
And even more so, you're gonna be family now.

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:30.580
Do you think I really do have to give up, at this point?

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:33.460
Well, I hate to sound harsh but...

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.250
You know, this time around, it's just not...

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:44.380
Huh! It's actually pretty nice.

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:48.130
Isn't it? It's a little far from the train station,
but it was a good find.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:50.380
For now, let's just get our stuff unloaded.

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:51.080
Okay.

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:54.960
Good job.

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:56.830
Oh! You're already here?

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:59.250
Yeah! We're almost done on our end.

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:03.380
We'll be under the same roof starting today, you know?

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:05.290
R-right...

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:08.330
The fact that I'm getting a younger brother
even at this point is exciting!

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.580
I'm gonna go into your room
and search for naughty things.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:11.750
Please don't!

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:16.210
We're going to be siblings,
so I'm putting a ban on formalities when we're home.

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:18.040
Oh... Okay.

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:24.250
And now, as to what to call each other.
Natsuo-kun can just stay Natsuo-kun. As for me...

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:25.920
Let's go with "Hina-chan"!

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:26.920
Huh?!

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:30.630
"Hina-chan." All right, repeat after me!

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:35.000
H..Hina-chan.

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:36.420
Just kidding! Just kidding!

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:39.460
Rui calls me "Hina-nee," so I'm fine with that!

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:43.330
Well, I'll be upstairs, so call me
when you need to carry the heavy stuff.

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:54.330
That's heavy. Let's see...

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:07.710
About that thing... You can just forget about it.

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:10.790
Nothing happened between you and me.

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:12.000
Got it?

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:15.000
If you do understand, then stop acting weird
like it's getting to you.

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:16.580
Wait!

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:26.000
Yeah, things do taste even better
when we all eat together for sure!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.830
I'll help out too.

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:30.830
Rui. Go take a bath after your big sis is done.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:31.880
Okay.

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:37.080
There's no way I can pretend that THAT didn't happen!

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:38.710
Ah! That was refreshing!

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:40.380
Whoa!

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:44.500
That felt good! The tub is nice and big!

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:45.670
Huh?

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:49.210
Eeeek!

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:50.880
Hey! What're you doing?!

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:54.040
S-sorry! I just did it out of habit...

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:59.250
This should be fine, right?

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:03.830
I'll be careful from now on! Now then, beer. Beer!

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.170
It's not that much different!

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:15.290
A drop of beer is worth a drop of blood!

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.500
That's totally a line out of a drunk's book.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.130
I wonder what's on.

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:20.500
Recite a Chinese poem.

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:20.960
Why?

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.460
Oh! I wanted to watch this!
No, it's not my Chinese poem. I can't do it.

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:24.540
No, no. Just think of it as yours.

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:26.960
No, no. You just think it is because you thought it was...

00:21:30.380 --> 00:21:34.710
Natsuo, we're headed to bed. Don't stay up too late.

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:35.540
Yeah...

00:21:35.670 --> 00:21:36.630
Night.

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:37.670
Goodnight.

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:39.080
Night.

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:51.790
What am I supposed to do about this...?

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:56.710
Sen- I mean, uh, Hina-nee.

00:21:57.380 --> 00:21:59.580
You'll catch a cold if you don't sleep in your bed.

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:03.210
Natsuo-kun...

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:04.580
Y-yes?!

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:11.000
I'm gonna do my best... To be a good big sis...

00:22:12.880 --> 00:22:14.460
Sensei...

00:22:20.880 --> 00:22:21.920
I know...

00:22:25.330 --> 00:22:26.500
I get it...

00:22:27.710 --> 00:22:28.580
But...

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:32.830
Just once...

00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:35.880
As the last thing I'll...

00:22:36.380 --> 00:22:37.500
Just once...

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:41.130
With this, I'll...

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:45.130
End it all, so...

00:22:53.040 --> 00:23:02.080
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni natte yuku

00:22:53.040 --> 00:23:02.080
Ah, I'll be selfish to you

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:06.920
Domestic Girlfriend

00:23:07.130 --> 00:23:14.420
Sasai na hibi no nandemo nai yasashisa wo

00:23:07.130 --> 00:23:14.420
Your little kindness in normal days

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:24.000
Daiji ni shimatte nandomo akete nagamete iru

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:24.000
I cherish them and open them often to look

00:23:24.580 --> 00:23:32.880
Kimi no honshin kikezu ni karamawari shitari shite

00:23:24.580 --> 00:23:32.880
I wouldn't be able to ask you about your feelings and losing my self

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:41.170
Kantan na koto hodo muzukashiku natte iru

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:41.170
The easiest things become harder to do

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:45.130
Otona ni nareba

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:45.130
If I become an adult,

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:57.630
Konna koto de nayamazu ni umaku ikirareru kana

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:57.630
I can live well without worrying about something like this?

00:23:58.460 --> 00:24:02.880
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni naru

00:23:58.460 --> 00:24:02.880
Ah, I become selfish just towards you

00:24:02.880 --> 00:24:07.080
Dondon jibun rashiku mo nakunatte

00:24:02.880 --> 00:24:07.080
I'll lose my self more & more

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:11.630
Ah mata kimochi ga sakibashitte

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:11.630
Ah, my feelings get ahead of myself again

00:24:11.630 --> 00:24:16.130
Dondon matomo ja nakunatteku kara

00:24:11.630 --> 00:24:16.130
I can't stand it more

00:24:16.130 --> 00:24:21.580
Sotchi wo minai de

00:24:16.130 --> 00:24:21.580
Don't look that way

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:28.000
Episode 2

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:28.000
By Any Chance,

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:28.000
Did We Do It?

00:24:24.290 --> 00:24:26.790
By any chance, did we do it?
